			"date": "2024-02-17T21:00:04.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> the reality probably is that everyone who knew how that code in iOS worked was fired for not hitting OKRs or are long-gone because they were hit by yearly random PIP and let go. So now the $5 per hour guy from Fiverrr had to implement all of this in a week. Wouldn’t be the first feature done like this.</p>",
